single shaft and hidden narrative verified.\n- [x] S6 Determinism: chapter starts, play-versus-seek digests, Replay zero.\n  EVIDENCE: both reports S6 PASS,9 assertions per viewport/run, play/seek and chapter digests agree, Replay resets exactly.\n- [x] S7 Restore/census: Return/Escape in both entry modes, exact snapshot restore, three warmed resource cycles without growth.\n  EVIDENCE: both reports S7 PASS,81 assertions per viewport/run; all four blueprint/exploded Return/Escape camera deltas0. Three warmed cycles have constant geometry/texture/program counts.\n- [x] S8 Rendered evidence: ten same-session beats per viewport, nonblank canvas statistics, static reduced/poster transcript and zero manufacturing requests.\n  EVIDENCE: both reports S8 PASS;13 actual completed-frame canvas captures per viewport/run with target draw witnesses, projection, epoch/time/stamp and nonblank statistics. Poster zero allCAD; reduced zero inspection assets with3 narrative CAD requests separately disclosed. V4 is not waived.\n\nEvidence: ../runtime/shaft/contact-parent-run-1/report.json and contact-parent-run-2/report.json, each exit0,16cases,12/12gates,zero defects/harness exceptions. Source and verifier hashes agree between runs. Fresh GLM correction review SHIP: ../shaft-stock-contact-correction-2026-10-06/glm-review.md. Desktop playback frame percentiles remain report-only; owner visual acceptance is separate.\n\nNewest handoff additions requested by parent; preserve S1..S8:\n\n- [x] N1 Shaft denied-fetch: visible error, usable Return/retry, successful recovery.\n  EVIDENCE: both reports N1 PASS,6 assertions per viewport/run; visible exact error and successful retry/Return/focus.\n- [x] N2 Shaft successful stale bytes: Return/reentry, late success cannot corrupt the new epoch/camera/resource census.\n  EVIDENCE: both reports N2 PASS,4 assertions per viewport/run; stale successful byte release cannot take current epoch ownership.\n- [x] N3 Shaft real WebGL context loss: exit once,