ntervals retain depth. All ten spaces complete by12.946510416666667s. Current kinematics SHA256 `2f78847da8cc70b350c7f22eed2c899d6289100f94011dc87533f1dd337bd893`.\n\nParent `npm test -- --maxWorkers=2`: exit0,43files/445tests PASS (`final-contact-tests-2026-10-06.log`). Parent `npm run build`: exit0,703modules,index-DFY-biXM.js/SceneCanvas-CoJldWVG.js (`final-contact-build-2026-10-06.log`). The hidden production preview was started after this build (PID33416,localhost:4173 HTTP200). Earlier preview PIDs below are historical and were no longer listening before this restart.\n\nVerifier cache identity is repaired without tolerance changes; current SHA256 `d26d491acbb8bac0e0803a48e60b01592e6c57eeb0ebc76d15275e213bc87c4a`. Failed historical reports remain diagnostic. Fresh GLM source review and paired parent production runs remain required; the earlier444-test build is superseded for current shaft acceptance. V4 owner policy and owner visual acceptance remain open.\n\nThese checks validate the recovered current code before any new source changes. They do not close browser, mechanical, performance or owner acceptance gates.\n\nContinuation preservation recheck: parent recomputed SHA-256 after the mobile camera edit. `Default.glb` remains `8b07246cf857aca29d1832815d8d183e0a1fd8ef06da5a7a089019706a57a257`; `m249-transformed.glb` remains `1c251f45b05b736a08858e47c53c8fa779870b636bb1a174d1422d8003305423`; `msp-enclosure.glb` remains `c1c919ab8f747e9e2bd9eeb51b5ac31ee66dc39145cac44ad7c8fddfa056428e`. All three match the protected baseline.\n\nParent reran the edited camera suite: `npm test -- --run src/scene/inspection/shaft/camera.test.ts --maxWorkers=2`, exit 0, 1 file / 10 tests PASS. Existing continuity, follow-law, held-view and final-card checks remain; the material-view exclusion now uses the measured top card and footer boundaries.\n\nAfter the footer camera and cold-poster metadata fixes, parent reran `npm test -- --run src/scene/inspection/shaft/camera.test.ts src/