tegration advisory are in progress. Final Fable call exhausted HTTP429 retries without verdict; explicit GLM substitution is recorded. V4 owner policy and owner visual acceptance remain open. No commit/push/deploy.\n\nCanonical requirements: docs/jgun-manufacturing-inspection-plan.md. Detailed leaf gates and execution log: project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/manufacturing-implementation-2026-10-05/PLAN.md.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
